{"id":89423990441264,"name":"Kebab Battles 🍖","desc":"OFFICIALLY RELEASED 10 MARCH, 2025\n\n🔥A silly fighting game made by a silly (handsome) man where you run around stabbing people with skewers to craft a very delicious kebab. Earn credits and unlock cool new skewers with cool new abilities.\n\n😎Join the group (https://www.roblox.com/communities/35504080/kebab-party) for codes, upcoming updates and other cool announcements.\n\nControls (also listed at the top of your screen)\n------------\nStab\n> PC: Click\n> Mobile: Tap\n> Console: RT / R2\n\nAbility\n> PC: Q\n> Mobile: Button\n> Console: LT / L2\n\nEat\n> PC: E\n> Mobile: Button\n> Console: X / Square\n------------\n\nExploiter? Type '/votekick whoever' in chat to create a server vote, please also report them in the community.\n\nCREDITS 🤤\nScripter: @Zinklog\nBuilder: @Zinklog, @m7nimal\nModeller: @Zinklog\nAnimator: @Zinklog\nVFX: @Zinklog\nUi: @Zinklog\nIcon & thumbnail: @Zinklog\nContributor: @Vysli @TypePosh\n\nSomewhat inspired by the other silly little game Slap Battles ✋","path":"/game/89423990441264-kebab-battles","slug":"89423990441264-kebab-battles","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/43d0596de0a2ef5b2989b83301365acd0f06446afef0d783955918e117d51e97.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bdfbaf82388fc54121746d3add6a82b3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":882940,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-23T16:46:13.975Z","creator":{"name":"kebab party","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Kebab-Battles-Update-op-hub-90625","_id":"6973a5d50d28d6d14f9f75ce","title":"Update op hub","game":{"_id":"6972bbd3c2959559a8052385","gameId":89423990441264,"name":"Kebab Battles 🍖","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":89423990441264},"features":"Killaura\nAuto stars\nTp\nSpee